  "explanation": "The primary failure is m_axis_tlast stuck at 0 (53 mismatches). The root cause is line 141 hardcoding m_axis_tlast_int=0 instead of propagating s_axis_tlast. patch_bdfb4e29768c fixes this directly. Secondary issues involve uninitialized registers during reset: m_axis_tdata_reg, m_axis_tdest_reg, temp_m_axis_tid_reg, temp_m_axis_tkeep_reg lack explicit reset assignments (patches c9bcd0ebf5ab, ec27a287b3cc, 8053be1dbae4, 9d11758b2afe). The frame pause logic incorrectly triggers when rate_by_frame=0 (patch_330141055bc5). The pause signal substitution (patch_177e84f089b9) and ready gating (patch_4c92a56408a4) address potential handshake sequencing issues observed in traces."
